                  <entry class="- topic/entry " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/conditions.dita" xtrc="entry:12;70:26">Short-circuit ring or rotor bar related problems.</entry>
               </row>
               <row class="- topic/row " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/conditions.dita" xtrc="row:5;72:21">
