                  </entry>
                  <entry class="- topic/entry " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/conditions.dita" xtrc="entry:23;97:26">Alignment</entry>
                  <entry class="- topic/entry " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/conditions.dita" xtrc="entry:24;98:26">Occurs when two rotating shafts (motor and load) are not aligned, creating external misalignment.</entry>
               </row>
               <row class="- topic/row " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/conditions.dita" xtrc="row:9;100:21">
